{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01SJWKVqidNnRmep84NtEeUn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. **Section 01 — Checkout Flow & Form UX** is written and committed.\n\n`answers/01-checkout-flow-form-ux.md` covers all 10 questions (7 Core + 3 Deep):\n\n**Core:**\n1. Multi-step checkout state machine — step gating via `StepGuard`, store + `sessionStorage` hydration, server-authoritative confirmation\n2. Card input UX — BIN detection from first 4 digits, format masking with cursor preservation, dynamic CVV length enforcement\n3. Validation timing — three-phase strategy (`change` → format only, `blur` → validate, `submit` → final), `touched` set per field, card-number special case\n4. Address autocomplete — 300ms debounce, silent failure → manual fallback, Places decomposition into structured fields, server-side validation required\n5. Loading state & double-submission — immediate disable, 1.5s reassurance message, 10s timeout UX, idempotency key + state-machine guard\n6. Order summary sync — optimistic subtotal, debounced recalc to server, race-condition sequence-number guard, coupon application flow\n7. Progressive disclosure — `hidden` vs unmount tradeoffs, `shouldUnregister` interaction, config-driven thresholds\n\n**Deep:**\n8. Saved payment method handoff — async recognition, inline OTP auth (no redirect), expired method detection + inline update\n9. Config-driven field system — `FieldConfig` schema, validator registry, feature-flag-driven rendering, safety rails against PCI fields\n10. Smart retry UX — what to clear vs keep, same PaymentIntent on retry, decline code messaging hierarchy (including `stolen_card` policy), 3-attempt cap\n\nNext up: `answers/02-payment-security-pci-compliance.md`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":363,"cache_read_input_tokens":54805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":363,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"deec6d0c-1337-4565-9116-ecd1be5fc177","uuid":"c9bd2da8-b892-4026-b67a-8491f0db09e1"}
